# Spec: Migrate the notification templates to the new renderer

Problem: the nine transactional emails in `mailer/templates/` are rendered by the legacy `render_legacy()` in `mailer/render.py`; it cannot do localisation. The new renderer (`mailer/render_v2.py`) can.

Approach: move each template to the v2 renderer one at a time, behind the existing `MAILER_RENDERER` setting, keeping legacy output byte-identical until the setting flips.

Out of scope: changing any template's wording; flipping the default.

Verification: a golden-file test per template, in `tests/mailer/test_golden.py`.

